      "writtenOn": "2021-02-15T11:38:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ISTM this is vastly more complex than it needs to be. The correct callback is already stored in the request and the existing code already knows where to find it. All this member is for, then, is figuring out which NRIs are TRACK_DEFAULTs.\n\nThis could be accomplished with a simple boolean. You could also choose to store the UID of the app here and -1 if not a TRACK_DEFAULT NRI, but we already have mUid in l.5652. Still, storing UID or -1 may be useful in comparisons below, not too sure. IIUC, this lets you remove  l.9577~9584 and vastly simplify the code that computes this member.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 5655,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 5669,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "443ee88f053900cfcea952f81336645a19d63acc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
