        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-02-15T11:38:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we should need this clause (things should work smoothly including for the default request).\nWhile you\u0027re at it, I think it\u0027s a more readable if the check for the type is done at the level above :\n\n  final nri;\n  if (TRACK_DEFAULT \u003d\u003d type) {\n    nri \u003d new NRI(trackDefaultRequests(uid, package), msgr, binder, tag)\n  } else {\n    nri \u003d new NRI(req, msgr, binder, tag)\n  }\n\n  private List\u003cNetworkRequest\u003e trackDefaultRequest(uid, packageName) {\n    NRI defaultReq \u003d findDefaultReqForUid();\n    return new NRI(..., copy(defaultReq)... )\n  }\n\n...this eliminates the additional NRI allocation and the new constructor for NRI (which you might still need for the update though, not sure)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 5981,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 5981,
        "endChar": 68
      },
      "revId": "443ee88f053900cfcea952f81336645a19d63acc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
